What's that look for?

00:17:07.004 --> 00:17:09.234
You're one to talk!

00:17:10.104 --> 00:17:12.534
EAT THIS!

00:17:20.584 --> 00:17:23.314
Sorry to disappoint you!

00:17:23.684 --> 00:17:25.374
Back at you!

00:17:25.614 --> 00:17:27.444
Kaoru...

00:17:31.224 --> 00:17:32.654
Hold it!

00:17:37.934 --> 00:17:43.334
Wh-What's wrong? You're looking kinda tired.

00:17:45.374 --> 00:17:48.774
Wh-Who is? I'm the Dodge King!

00:17:48.774 --> 00:17:51.864
I'm not quitting till I smack you with this!

00:17:52.144 --> 00:17:54.234
G-Glad to hear it!

00:18:15.934 --> 00:18:20.234
Okay! That's it for today!

00:18:20.744 --> 00:18:25.674
We'll... We'll hold off on the
challenge till next PE class, okay?

00:18:26.214 --> 00:18:28.644
F... Fine with me.

00:18:34.054 --> 00:18:36.384
My optical camouflage function!

00:18:38.294 --> 00:18:40.524
Hold it! You're not getting away!

00:18:47.304 --> 00:18:48.564
Kanai.

00:18:48.804 --> 00:18:51.894
Tono... About what I did...

00:18:52.474 --> 00:18:54.064
I'm sorry!

00:18:54.504 --> 00:18:58.914
Ancient history. I've forgotten it... Chisato.

00:19:03.884 --> 00:19:06.444
Minamoto! You called us?!

00:19:08.554 --> 00:19:10.254
Why's he dancing?

00:19:10.254 --> 00:19:12.654
And why's he wearing the weird cosplay?

00:19:13.694 --> 00:19:15.784
Something's here!

00:19:16.564 --> 00:19:17.994
Help me!

00:19:17.994 --> 00:19:20.764
But, we're at school.
Can we use our powers here?

00:19:20.764 --> 00:19:24.904
It's an emergency! The Children, released!

00:19:24.904 --> 00:19:25.404
<<RELEASED>>
It's an emergency! The Children, released!

00:19:34.544 --> 00:19:36.344
Someone somewhere is calling us!

00:19:36.344 --> 00:19:38.114
And we go to mete out punishment!

00:19:38.184 --> 00:19:40.254
Because if we don't, who will?

00:19:40.254 --> 00:19:41.944
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:19:42.224 --> 00:19:44.194
Answering your hopes, we are now...

00:19:44.194 --> 00:19:45.624
RELEASED!

00:19:47.524 --> 00:19:49.224
Out of my way!

00:19:51.694 --> 00:19:52.594
Forfeited!

00:20:01.944 --> 00:20:04.934
I see. This guy definitely needs to be punished.

00:20:05.744 --> 00:20:07.314
Kaoru?

00:20:07.314 --> 00:20:08.614
You heard her!

00:20:08.614 --> 00:20:09.514
Right!

00:20:09.514 --> 00:20:11.504
PSYCHIC...

00:20:11.614 --> 00:20:14.914
DESTROY SHOOT!

00:20:20.464 --> 00:20:22.554
That's enough.

00:20:27.964 --> 00:20:31.264
I was right. It was you, huh?

00:20:32.034 --> 00:20:33.544
Chief?!

00:20:33.544 --> 00:20:36.704
Of course there'd be more than one prototype.

00:20:37.274 --> 00:20:39.814
I should have realized sooner.

00:20:39.814 --> 00:20:42.914
But... But, that boy...

00:20:42.914 --> 00:20:45.614
He was bullying my girls...

00:20:45.854 --> 00:20:49.024
I COULDN'T HELP MYSELF!

00:20:49.024 --> 00:20:51.594
Oh, don't give me that. Let's go.

00:20:51.594 --> 00:20:52.594
You'll pay for your crimes!

00:20:52.594 --> 00:20:54.094
La... La-la-la...
You'll pay for your crimes!

00:20:54.094 --> 00:20:55.594
La... La-la-la...

00:20:55.594 --> 00:20:57.294
And don't start singing!

00:20:57.294 --> 00:20:58.764
Delivery!

00:20:58.994 --> 00:21:01.504
From the chief to the three Children?

00:21:01.504 --> 00:21:03.494
Nothing unusual inside.

00:21:04.034 --> 00:21:05.604
Thanks.

00:21:05.604 --> 00:21:08.174
Well, gotta run.

00:21:08.174 --> 00:21:11.244
Shame on you, dating another
girl when you have a girlfriend!

00:21:11.244 --> 00:21:13.744
Why don't you give her that ring in your pocket?

00:21:13.744 --> 00:21:17.184
Don't look! Don't read me! Agh, I'm sorry!

00:21:17.314 --> 00:21:18.684
It feels good...

00:21:18.684 --> 00:21:19.674
to do good!

00:21:20.014 --> 00:21:22.654
I never thought he'd buy this stuff for us.

00:21:22.654 --> 00:21:25.354
I know he asked us what we wanted,
but is it really all right?

00:21:25.654 --> 00:21:27.314
I'm... not sure.

00:21:27.624 --> 00:21:31.994
Um, K-Kashiwagi... This claim form...

00:21:31.994 --> 00:21:33.604
Aren't there too many zeros on this cost?

00:21:33.604 --> 00:21:37.834
No, sir. The optical camouflage jacket
is an experimental prototype.

00:21:37.974 --> 00:21:41.334
And I suppose I did say I'd pay
for the repairs myself...

00:21:41.844 --> 00:21:45.314
Um... I can write off half of this as costs, right?

00:21:45.314 --> 00:21:46.404
NO!

00:21:47.914 --> 00:21:49.714
And you got this?

00:21:49.914 --> 00:21:53.314
Yeah! I need special training for my next match!

00:21:53.314 --> 00:21:55.224
Special training, huh?

00:21:55.224 --> 00:21:56.654
Can you help?

00:21:56.884 --> 00:21:59.524
Sure, that won't be too hard.

00:21:59.524 --> 00:22:01.924
Okay, let's start now!

00:22:02.024 --> 00:22:05.264
Training, start! Take this, Minamoto!

00:22:05.264 --> 00:22:07.234
Wait, Kaoru! Wait a sec-

00:22:19.414 --> 00:22:24.544
Kakushitemo muda da yo

00:22:24.854 --> 00:22:28.914
Nandemo zenbu wakaru

00:22:29.654 --> 00:22:35.094
Fushigi ja nai yo datte atashi wa

00:22:35.464 --> 00:22:40.864
Anata wo ai shite n da mon

00:22:41.104 --> 00:22:45.504
Hora kochi muite

00:22:45.774 --> 00:22:50.074
Maji de love x love musubareru no wa

00:22:50.074 --> 00:22:52.044
Zettai nan desu!!

00:22:52.274 --> 00:22:56.984
Zutto eien fuhen

00:22:56.984 --> 00:23:03.624
Everest kara sekaiju ni zettai sengen!

00:23:03.624 --> 00:23:08.464
Mou uketomete

00:23:08.464 --> 00:23:12.864
Futari love x love musubareru no wa

00:23:12.864 --> 00:23:15.064
Zettai nan desu!

00:23:15.064 --> 00:23:19.504
Yappa daian kibou

00:23:19.804 --> 00:23:23.914
San Pietro de chikau ai no

00:23:23.914 --> 00:23:26.704
Zettai sengen!

00:23:39.894 --> 00:23:40.824
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.824 --> 00:23:42.854
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:45.594
You should have just said we were
doing an ECM test from the start.

00:23:45.594 --> 00:23:47.834
If you knew about the ECM test beforehand,

00:23:47.834 --> 00:23:49.934
we wouldn't get proper results.

00:23:49.934 --> 00:23:51.804
What else are you hiding?

00:23:51.804 --> 00:23:53.334
Just the part about the ECM!

00:23:53.334 --> 00:23:55.944
Say, Minamoto... What is ECM?

00:23:55.944 --> 00:23:57.544
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.544 --> 00:24:00.744
Episode 7: "Ordinary!
The Children, Restrained!"

00:24:00.744 --> 00:24:04.354
We are those who stand firm against
you on behalf of normal humanity!

00:24:04.354 --> 00:24:04.914
The Normal People!

00:24:04.914 --> 00:24:05.954
Ordinary! The Children, Restrained
The Normal People!

00:24:05.954 --> 00:24:08.554
Ordinary! The Children, Restrained
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.554 --> 00:24:09.884
Ordinary! The Children, Restrained
